{"1": "<div class=\"card-inner\">\n      <div class=\"layer bg\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer bg-holo\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer glitter\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer frame-holo\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer inner-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer subject\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer subject-holo\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"cost\"><b>8</b></div>\n      <div class=\"rarity\">UR</div>\n\n      <div class=\"plate\">\n        <div class=\"name\"><span class=\"epi\">光輪の招き手</span><h1>シロガネ</h1></div>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <span class=\"tribe\">光輪</span>\n          <p class=\"effect\">このキャラクターは、場にある他の<span class=\"kw\">〈光輪〉</span>カード1枚につき、コストが1下がる。</p>\n          <p class=\"flavor\">「さあ、こちら側へ。光はもう、君を選んでいる」</p>\n          <div class=\"foot\">\n            <span class=\"no\">001 / 040 · TRENDS</span>\n            <span class=\"power\"><small>POWER</small><b>8000</b></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"layer glare\"></div>", "2": "<div class=\"card-inner\">\n      <div class=\"layer frame\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer emboss-lo\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer emboss-hi\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer emboss-face\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer frame-red\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"layer win\"><div class=\"layer bg\"></div><div class=\"layer speed\"></div><div class=\"layer sparks\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"layer inner-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer subject\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer subject-shine\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"cost\"><b>6</b></div>\n      <div class=\"rarity\">SEC</div>\n\n      <div class=\"plate\">\n        <div class=\"name\"><span class=\"epi\">紅蓮の簒奪者</span><h1 class=\"foil\">レン</h1></div>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <span class=\"tribe\">紅蓮</span>\n          <p class=\"effect\"><span class=\"kw\">速攻</span>（場に出たターンに攻撃できる）。このキャラクターが攻撃したとき、相手の手札を1枚選んで捨てさせる。</p>\n          <p class=\"flavor\">「遅えよ。全部、俺がもらってく」</p>\n          <div class=\"foot\">\n            <span class=\"serial\">SERIAL<b>No. 007 / 100</b></span>\n            <span class=\"power\"><small>POWER</small><b class=\"foil\">7200</b></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"layer glare\"></div>", "3": "<div class=\"card-inner\">\n      <div class=\"layer frame\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer frame-iri\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer frame-stars\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"layer win\">\n        <div class=\"layer bg\"></div>\n        <div class=\"layer ripple\"></div>\n        <div class=\"layer art-stars\"></div>\n        <div class=\"layer bubbles\">\n          <i style=\"--x:8%;--s:11%;--d:9s;--dl:-2s;--sw:18\"></i>\n          <i style=\"--x:26%;--s:6%;--d:7s;--dl:-5s;--sw:-12\"></i>\n          <i style=\"--x:44%;--s:9%;--d:11s;--dl:-8s;--sw:14\"></i>\n          <i style=\"--x:63%;--s:5%;--d:6.5s;--dl:-1s;--sw:-10\"></i>\n          <i style=\"--x:78%;--s:12%;--d:10s;--dl:-6s;--sw:-16\"></i>\n          <i style=\"--x:90%;--s:7%;--d:8s;--dl:-3.5s;--sw:10\"></i>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"layer inner-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer subject\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layer subject-shine\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"cost\"><b>5</b></div>\n      <div class=\"rarity\">SP</div>\n\n      <div class=\"plate\">\n        <div class=\"name\"><span class=\"epi\">天空の歌姫</span><h1>ミナモ</h1></div>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <span class=\"tribe\">蒼空</span>\n          <p class=\"effect\">このキャラクターが場に出たとき、自分の山札の上から3枚を見て、<span class=\"kw\">〈蒼空〉</span>カード1枚を手札に加える。</p>\n          <p class=\"flavor\">「みんなー！ 今日も空から、こんにちはっ！」</p>\n          <div class=\"foot\">\n            <span class=\"no\">023 / 040 · TRENDS</span>\n            <span class=\"power\"><small>POWER</small><b>6500</b></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"layer glare\"></div>"}